From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:10:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(theme): add a blueprint style beside ink and comic

Light-first drafting look: cold-paper body with an ink-blue accent and a 16px
fine + 80px module grid on the app background; the dark variant switches to a
deep navy paper with a sky-blue accent. Wired as a third ThemeStyle next to the
upstream ink/comic pair (no table-driven generalisation): the composable learns
one more value and class, getThemeOverrides takes an isBlueprint flag with its
own palette, and the style picker gains one option in all 12 locales.
